OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFire service 'limited' to protect
OL,4,Aheritage sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) does not
OL,7,Fhave enough resources to adequately
OL,8,Fassess and protect London's heritage
OL,9,Fsites from future blazes, City Hall has
OL,10,Fbeen told.
OL,12,FLast year, more than 800 fire incidents
OL,13,Fhappened in or within 50ft (15m) of a
OL,14,Fheritage site, which generally do not
OL,15,Fmeet the requirements of current fire
OL,16,Fsafety regulations.
OL,18,FIn recent years, the capital has seen
OL,19,Ffires at Somerset House in 2024, Grade
OL,20,FII* listed St Mark's church in St
OL,21,FJohn's Wood in 2023 and Battersea Arts
OL,22,FCentre in 2015.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
