OL,3,GNEWSAFire service 'limited' to protect
OL,4,Aheritage sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe LFB said prevention was the "best
OL,7,Fway to protect London's historic and
OL,8,Fculturally significant buildings" and
OL,9,Fsaid fire protection was a "shared
OL,10,Fresponsibility".
